  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The role of civil society in building peace in Colombia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Grassroots communities, particularly those who have suffered the most under years of conflict, are an integral part of building peace in Colombia. The IAF supports community-led solutions to enhance peace and security and promote human rights in Colombia. Our grantee partner, Fundacin Desarrollo y Paz (Fundepaz), supports three victims grassroots organizations in Nario department to contribute to building peace in their territories by increasing their capacity to monitor the implementation of the Colombian peace accords, strengthen a regional advocacy center, and contribute to the historical memory of Colombias conflict. This grant is part of the IAFs broader initiative to build a just and lasting peace in Colombia.</narrative>
  </description>
